1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:48,360
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

4
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:52,200
JIEDE

5
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:57,200
Wait.

6
00:01:58,160 --> 00:02:00,160
His Lordship
will have peace resting in the Study,

7
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:02,320
but why the rush?

8
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:05,040
He's only just married.
And you didn't try to stop him?

9
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:07,000
Governess, how would I dare?

10
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:13,240
Go. Take good care of His Lordship.

11
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:14,400
Yes.

12
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:20,640
Madam, things have gone on since midnight.

13
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:21,960
You must be tired.

14
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,640
The Dowager Lady has excused you
from today's morning greeting.

15
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:26,880
I'll look after the Study.

16
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,960
Don't worry about a thing.

17
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:31,200
Go back to your room, Madam.
A nap won't hurt.

18
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,720
Please thank the Dowager Lady
for her kindness.

19
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,080
Governess Miao, please go about your work.

20
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:37,720
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

21
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,480
Governess Miao…

22
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:54,000
Bitao, the old me…

23
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,480
BLISS

24
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,720
I mean,

25
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:01,640
did Lord Lu and I ever have a feud?

26
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:05,160
I need to go see Madam.
Don't let anyone know. Understood?

27
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,360
I understand. Don't worry, Governess.

28
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:12,520
Governess Miao, in such a hurry so early,

29
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,800
- where are you off to?
- Governess Miao…

30
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,840
GEJIN,
MAID OF THE EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

31
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:18,400
Governess Wu sent me.

32
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:24,120
Well, Dowager Lady is always worried
about His Lordship's illness.

33
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:26,120
Heaven had mercy.

34
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,800
As soon as the Young Lady married in,
the marriage really did cure him.

35
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:33,160
I thought I'd hurry
to the Wei Residence with the good news.

36
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,840
Do you have an exit pass?

37
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,480
The Duchess gave orders long ago

38
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,640
that His Lordship has just woken
from a serious illness

39
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,360
and needs quiet rest.

40
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:45,520
Songyue Hall is to be closed for now.

41
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,440
Not just outsiders,

42
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:50,000
even the masters of the second,
third, and fourth branches,

43
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:53,080
and His Lordship's cousins, may not visit.

44
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:56,080
So nothing disturbs his recovery.

45
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:58,520
The Duke's Residence has its rules.

46
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,720
Without the master's order,

47
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:03,280
female servants of the inner household
may not pass messages outside.

48
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,440
Governess Wu, keep this in mind,

49
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,960
so you don't break the rules later

50
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,800
and make things hard for Madam.

51
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,240
It was careless of me.

52
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,519
Thank you for the reminder,
Governess Miao.

53
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:21,160
I must go to the Tea Room
to check on Madam's bean porridge.

54
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:24,680
<i>The one who should've died didn't,</i>

55
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,840
<i>- and I can't get word out either.</i>
- Why are you still standing here?

56
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:29,120
<i>- What should I do?</i>
- You're dismissed. Go.

57
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:31,200
You're saying she pushed Lady Xie?

58
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:32,920
No.

59
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,600
I pushed Lady Xie in,

60
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:39,120
and Lord Lu saw it all.

61
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,800
Then could it be

62
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:46,080
that Lady Xie

63
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,480
is the woman Lord Lu loves?

64
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:53,280
No wonder he looked at me
like he wanted to eat me alive.

65
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:58,240
Then this feud runs really deep.

66
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:02,160
<i>If he really drives me out,</i>

67
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:04,320
<i>rumors will hurt the Wei family,</i>

68
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:06,560
<i>and those people will never let me go.</i>

69
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:09,840
<i>If others fail,</i>
<i>at worst they just part ways.</i>

70
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:13,000
<i>If I fail,</i>
<i>I'll be sent to the chopping block.</i>

71
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:16,560
<i>No. Staying in the Duke's Residence</i>
<i>is my only way to survive.</i>

72
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,440
I didn't dare ask before,

73
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,560
but did the scar on your face

74
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:28,760
happen back then?

75
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:31,640
It's nothing.

76
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:36,200
Now, His Lordship
holds this grudge against you.

77
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:40,000
You must be very careful.

78
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,960
Thank you for the heads-up.

79
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,040
I know what to do.

80
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,760
SHIZHAI

81
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,320
My Lord,

82
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,240
it's time for your medicine.

83
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,360
Go away.

84
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:09,880
Serving a husband his medicinal decoction
is a wife's duty.

85
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,480
However much you despise me,

86
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:14,920
I must still do my duty.

87
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,880
You were only vicious before.

88
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:21,680
Now you're a hypocrite too.

89
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:24,560
Spare me your sweet talk and your act.

90
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,520
Tell me the truth.

91
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,040
You agreed to a bridal marriage
to ward off my illness.

92
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,960
- What are you really after?
- I…

93
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,880
That's easy for you to say, My Lord.

94
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:46,040
You're a hero admired by all,

95
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:49,600
and the Duchess got an Imperial Edict from
the Empress Dowager for this marriage.

96
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,920
If I openly broke it off,

97
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,600
the Wei family would be defying
the edict and breaking faith.

98
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:57,760
My family would be condemned.

99
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:59,440
I had no choice,

100
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,480
but now that I've married you,

101
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,320
I am your wife.

102
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:07,280
My Lord, please be generous.

103
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:09,720
Since I married you
to ward off your illness,

104
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,880
- let's not dwell on the past…
- Don't even think about it.

105
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,200
I will never take

106
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:18,920
an arrogant and ruthless woman
with a viper's heart as my wife.

107
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:21,560
You are even less worthy
of being the Lu family's principal wife.

108
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,760
Grandmother forced this marriage,

109
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:26,160
so you may keep the betrothal gifts.

110
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,000
In three days,

111
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,640
go and take your leave of Grandmother.

112
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,960
Tell her we're not of one mind
and can't be husband and wife.

113
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:38,120
Pack and leave my family.

114
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:41,000
As for all the evil things you did before,

115
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,240
I'll never speak of them.

116
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:47,080
If you refuse,

117
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:51,480
I'll tell the elders myself
and have you thrown out.

118
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:55,920
When you lose all dignity then,

119
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,720
you'll have only yourself to blame.

120
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:03,840
You're very ill, My Lord.
Please take your medicine first.

121
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,080
Don't touch me.

122
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,920
It's all scalded red.

123
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,280
<i>What a heartless man.</i>

124
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,200
<i>Begging him won't help.</i>

125
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:32,799
Physician Zhao is coming
to change His Lordship's dressing.

126
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:35,240
I'll take my leave.

127
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:48,400
My Lord,

128
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:51,240
I watched you grow up.

129
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:54,720
In the past,
even when servants made mistakes,

130
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:57,040
you'd forgive them.

131
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,440
Your new bride has just married in

132
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:01,920
and hasn't done anything seriously wrong.

133
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:05,760
Why are you so harsh with her?

134
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,240
Governess,

135
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,520
people are foolish.

136
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:12,600
They judge by looks.

137
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:16,080
Charmed by beauty, they trust the wicked.

138
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:19,520
Some people have only beautiful skin,

139
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,240
but their hearts are vicious,

140
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,800
<i>cruel, and twisted.</i>

141
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:26,760
<i>They treat human life as nothing.</i>

142
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:30,040
Such people are scarier than ghosts.

143
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:32,440
Even if she were as lovely as a fairy,

144
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:35,080
she would still make me shudder.

145
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,920
Never mind sharing a bed,

146
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:42,520
even sharing a room with her

147
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,840
is more than I can bear.

148
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:03,080
Are these not to your taste, My Lady?

149
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,920
I'll have them taken away and remade.

150
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,360
You know me.

151
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:09,920
Look at all this.

152
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:14,400
Roasted meat, steamed dish,
cured chicken and dried venison…

153
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,840
And this Sliced…

154
00:10:17,920 --> 00:10:19,680
Sliced Fish with Golden Relish.

155
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:27,360
At home, we couldn't even afford pastries.

156
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:30,080
When I first ate meat
at the Wei Residence,

157
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:31,600
I had vomiting and diarrhea all night.

158
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:35,720
I must be born poor,
unable to enjoy such things.

159
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,880
Have some wheat meal today, My Lady.

160
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:43,080
Later, add some minced fish
and get used to it slowly.

161
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:51,120
You asked Physician Zhao for medicine

162
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:54,120
to heal the scars on your hands…

163
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:58,320
My Lady, what are you doing?
I don't deserve this.

164
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:02,040
I asked Governess Miao

165
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:04,040
to get it from Physician Zhao.

166
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:06,840
It's Jade Beauty Powder that fades scars.

167
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:10,800
It's a little late to use it now.
I hope it still works.

168
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:18,720
Thank you, My Lady.

169
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:26,880
My Lady,

170
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:29,840
I heard you've lost your appetite,

171
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:34,120
so I had the kitchen make some
light bean porridge and flatbread.

172
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:35,120
Please try some.

173
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:37,200
That's thoughtful of you, Governess.

174
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,840
Is there something else, Governess?

175
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:58,040
Since His Lordship moved out,

176
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,920
everyone in Songyue Hall is talking.

177
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:03,400
They say he's unhappy with this marriage

178
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:05,600
and dislikes his new bride.

179
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:07,560
Well…

180
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:09,240
As I see it,

181
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:12,120
you need to find a way to fix this

182
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:15,000
and win His Lordship over.

183
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:18,280
Do you have a good idea, Governess?

184
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,280
As is the custom,

185
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:22,800
the Old Madam will introduce you
to the Lu family relatives.

186
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:25,840
A new bride
must present gifts to her elders.

187
00:12:26,560 --> 00:12:29,160
Why not use this chance
to make some embroidered goods

188
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:32,360
to please the Old Madam and Mother?

189
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:35,600
With the elders on your side,

190
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:38,280
His Lordship can't go against filial duty.

191
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,480
Embroidered goods?

192
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:44,640
I'm no expert at embroidery,

193
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,240
but I often did it at home.

194
00:12:48,040 --> 00:12:49,920
That's perfect.

195
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,200
To secure your place
in the Duke's Residence,

196
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:55,200
you must work hard, My Lady.

197
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,240
Thank you for the advice, Governess.

198
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:59,200
You're welcome, My Lady.

199
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:02,760
The bean porridge is getting cold.
Eat it while it's warm.

200
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,640
Go to sleep.

201
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:43,680
Remember to apply the medicine first.

202
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:46,240
It needs to be mixed with water.

203
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:49,640
The kitchen will bring cow's milk
tomorrow morning.

204
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,160
It is better mixing it with milk.

205
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:55,800
It's already the second watch.
Please get some rest, My Lady.

206
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:57,760
Don't worry about me.

207
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,120
I'm used to working late at home.

208
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,880
I can't do fine crafts,

209
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:04,000
but my embroidery is good enough to show.

210
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,360
My Lady,

211
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:09,360
when a lady from a family
like the Wei Residence marries,

212
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:11,840
not just the gifts for relatives,

213
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,720
even the embroidered rewards for servants

214
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:15,520
are made by the household embroiderers
over three years

215
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,480
and prepared well in advance.

216
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:19,400
Why would you do it yourself?

217
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:23,640
- Governess Wu clearly…
- I see.

218
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:26,320
She's taking advantage of my ignorance,

219
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,720
playing tricks to wear me out.

220
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,680
I won't obey her in everything,

221
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:35,800
so she wants me
to make a fool of myself in public.

222
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:37,560
Thank you for telling me.

223
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:39,960
Go to sleep.

224
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:45,640
Are you still going to embroider, My Lady?

225
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:46,600
Yes.

226
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:50,280
If you really can't sleep, why not tell me

227
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:53,720
what the Wei Residence sent as my dowry?

228
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:01,160
When a lady from a family
like the Wei Residence marries,

229
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:03,680
the dowry is always prepared
well in advance…

230
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,440
Grandmother.

231
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,800
Rao, you're here.

232
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:43,480
You've already met the Dowager Lady
and your mother-in-law.

233
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:46,240
This is your Second Aunt.

234
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,440
ZHUO CHENGJUN, SECOND DAUGHTER-IN-LAW
OF THE DUKE OF YING

235
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:50,240
Greetings, Second Aunt.

236
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,440
Greetings.

237
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:55,440
Come. Let me take a good look at you.

238
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:06,360
Mother, let me be honest,
and don't be cross.

239
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:11,680
Everyone says the two Young Ladies
of our family are the finest,

240
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:15,400
but today,
after seeing His Lordship's new bride,

241
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:20,040
I finally know
there's always someone better.

242
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:22,920
Such a beautiful
and outstanding young lady

243
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:27,280
makes the ladies of our family
look plain by comparison.

244
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:28,800
Well.

245
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:31,120
I love hearing that.

246
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:34,360
Look at Rao. Not only is she beautiful,

247
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:37,760
but she's also blessed
with the best fortune in the world.

248
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:43,200
This lucky girl is one I risked my pride
to snatch for us.

249
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:45,360
Yes.

250
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:49,120
Indeed.

251
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:51,480
Old Madam is very strict.

252
00:16:51,560 --> 00:16:53,960
Look how she treasured
this delicate granddaughter,

253
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:57,200
afraid she'd melt in her mouth
or be lost from her arms.

254
00:16:57,800 --> 00:17:01,240
She never showed up at ordinary
tea gatherings or flower banquets.

255
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,960
Thanks to your good eye, Mother,

256
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:05,000
you arranged this match
for His Lordship early

257
00:17:05,079 --> 00:17:07,760
and brought this lovely flower
into our home.

258
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,000
This is your Third Aunt.

259
00:17:12,079 --> 00:17:12,920
Third Aunt.

260
00:17:13,520 --> 00:17:15,560
REN YUZHEN,
THIRD DAUGHTER-IN-LAW OF THE DUKE OF YING

261
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:18,040
Good timing.
Come and greet your sisters-in-law.

262
00:17:18,119 --> 00:17:18,960
Come.

263
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:25,520
This is Changning, and this is Changhui.
They're your younger cousins.

264
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:29,040
Rao.

265
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:30,200
LU CHANGHUI, DAUGHTER OF
THE THIRD BRANCH, DUKE OF YING'S RESIDENCE

266
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:31,360
LU CHANGNING, DAUGHTER OF THE
SECOND BRANCH, DUKE OF YING'S RESIDENCE

267
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:32,960
Greetings, cousins.

268
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:36,600
This is your cousin and my niece, Weiyu.

269
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:39,520
HE WEIYU, NIECE OF HE WANNIANG

270
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:41,880
- Rao.
- Weiyu.

271
00:17:45,040 --> 00:17:46,240
Bitao.

272
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:48,920
CLOUDS DRIFT, RAIN NOURISHES

273
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:54,000
The gift prepared at home
was too dull in color.

274
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:57,920
I feared you might not like it,
so I made a new one myself.

275
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:00,120
I hope you like it.

276
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:10,280
Dowager Lady,

277
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:12,760
Madam called Guanzhu and Yinyu over

278
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:16,760
to ask about
your favorite colors and patterns.

279
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:19,480
At the third watch,
Bitao was still changing the candles.

280
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:23,120
She stayed up two nights
and put her heart into it.

281
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:27,560
You made this for me yourself.

282
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:30,520
Wearing it, I can feel your devotion.

283
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:32,440
How could I not like it?

284
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,520
You're too kind, Grandmother.

285
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:37,720
Even my rough needlework
finds favor in your eyes.

286
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:41,320
Back home,
Grandmother always said I was clumsy.

287
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:45,200
Giving my embroidery to elders
might embarrass me before a noble family.

288
00:18:46,040 --> 00:18:48,080
So we had embroiderers
from Jiguang Pavilion

289
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:51,320
to make better gifts for all the elders
and my younger cousins.

290
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:54,800
- Governess Wu,
- Yes?

291
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,400
why are you standing there?

292
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:04,320
I had you count them out last night.

293
00:19:04,840 --> 00:19:08,480
I sewed those pearl-adorned
silver-trimmed shoes myself

294
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:10,120
for Mother.

295
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:16,440
Second Aunt,
you're so elegant and radiant.

296
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:20,360
The gold-inlaid cloud-and-bird
embroidered apron suits you perfectly.

297
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,600
How thoughtful.

298
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:24,880
And a gold-flower
purple silk outer garment

299
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:29,000
that matches your outfit today,
Third Aunt.

300
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:30,880
I have one, too?

301
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:35,120
Fourth Aunt, you have refined taste.

302
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:38,160
I have a bedside incense burner
with wheels on its four feet.

303
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:39,800
It's finely made.

304
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:42,000
- You'll surely love it.
- Thank you.

305
00:19:42,600 --> 00:19:43,920
There's also a jade box

306
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,680
full of ornamental hairpins
and dangling hair ornaments.

307
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:46,720
Bring that too.

308
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:50,800
Grandmother chose them carefully
for me to give to my cousins.

309
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:06,400
Did you hear?
The Dowager Lady wants to see them.

310
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:10,000
Don't keep her waiting. Hurry.

311
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:15,680
Yes, I'll bring them right away.

312
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:23,440
<i>The three days are almost up.</i>

313
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:25,240
<i>I got past Grandmother,</i>

314
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:27,240
<i>but how do I deal with Lu Zhuo?</i>

315
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:32,680
<i>Heavens,</i>
<i>you should've taken him back then too.</i>

316
00:20:32,760 --> 00:20:34,400
<i>Being a rich widow</i>

317
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,800
<i>beats being thrown out.</i>

318
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:39,000
Young Master.

319
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:41,800
Slow down, Fifth Young Master!

320
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,240
LU CHE, SECOND SON OF
THE THIRD BRANCH, DUKE OF YING'S RESIDENCE

321
00:20:45,840 --> 00:20:46,640
Fifth Young Master.

322
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:49,880
Young Master, please come down.

323
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:52,240
Be careful, Young Master!

324
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,200
- Fifth Young Master.
- My Lady.

325
00:20:56,280 --> 00:20:57,280
- Fifth Young Master.
- My Lady.

326
00:20:57,360 --> 00:21:00,880
- My Lady.
- Where did he get hurt? Wake up.

327
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:02,440
Fifth Young Master.

328
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,880
My Lady, are you hurt?

329
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,960
Fifth Young Master, wake up.

330
00:21:06,040 --> 00:21:07,440
Which branch do you serve?

331
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:11,120
How could you let a child climb so high?
Stop crying and get help.

332
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:13,280
Yes.

333
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:18,000
A fall can be minor or serious.

334
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:21,680
Since we saw it, we can't ignore it.

335
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:25,560
Governess Wu,
Bitao is young and doesn't know much.

336
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:28,000
Please go and fetch
Governess Miao yourself.

337
00:21:28,080 --> 00:21:29,320
And the Physician too, if possible.

338
00:21:30,280 --> 00:21:32,520
- Well…
- Please.

339
00:21:34,560 --> 00:21:35,640
Noted.

340
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:48,440
My Lord, time for your medicine.

341
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:53,040
Help me up.

342
00:21:53,120 --> 00:21:54,080
Yes.

343
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:09,120
What happened?

344
00:22:10,080 --> 00:22:11,640
The Dowager Lady and Third Madam
have come to see Madam.

345
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:13,280
They're talking inside.

346
00:22:14,080 --> 00:22:15,360
She hasn't moved out yet?

347
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:23,640
Help me up.

348
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:25,160
Physician Zhao said you mustn't move.

349
00:22:25,760 --> 00:22:26,640
Why are you…

350
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:32,720
Careful, My Lord.

351
00:22:39,720 --> 00:22:42,320
This boy has always been
naughty and reckless,

352
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:44,360
running around like a headless fly.

353
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:47,760
Luckily you caught him in time.

354
00:22:47,840 --> 00:22:49,400
If he'd landed on his head,

355
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:51,720
even if he weren't crippled,

356
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:53,680
he'd have ended up a fool.

357
00:22:53,760 --> 00:22:55,680
Che told me later

358
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:58,680
that Zhuo made that kite for him.

359
00:22:59,840 --> 00:23:01,960
He just cherishes his brother.

360
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:04,840
He meant well. Please don't blame him.

361
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:06,000
Okay.

362
00:23:06,080 --> 00:23:07,480
Good girl.

363
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:10,640
You look pale, and your voice sounds off.

364
00:23:10,720 --> 00:23:12,640
Let's call the Physician.

365
00:23:16,360 --> 00:23:19,320
It's just a sprain. Nothing serious.

366
00:23:20,280 --> 00:23:23,000
Forgive me for causing you worry.
I've failed in my filial duty.

367
00:23:25,560 --> 00:23:26,800
You have indeed.

368
00:23:29,840 --> 00:23:32,760
Zhuo, why are you out of bed?

369
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:37,560
How do you look after him?

370
00:23:37,640 --> 00:23:40,080
He's so sick that a breeze
could knock him over,

371
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:43,080
and you let him wander around?
Do you want a caning?

372
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:46,560
- Forgive me, Dowager Lady. I…
- Don't blame him.

373
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:48,240
I ordered it.

374
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:51,920
My wife is hurt.

375
00:23:52,800 --> 00:23:53,920
As her husband,

376
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,480
how could I not visit her?

377
00:24:09,560 --> 00:24:11,880
I heard you got hurt saving Che.

378
00:24:13,520 --> 00:24:15,080
Where are you hurt?

379
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:18,280
Just a sprained right arm.

380
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:21,200
Go ask Physician Zhao to examine her.

381
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:24,360
It's a small injury.
A few days' rest will do.

382
00:24:27,680 --> 00:24:29,720
No need to call a doctor and make a fuss.

383
00:24:29,800 --> 00:24:31,920
Physician Zhao has sharp eyes.

384
00:24:32,760 --> 00:24:35,720
How you were hurt,
where, and when it will heal,

385
00:24:36,760 --> 00:24:37,800
he'll know them at a glance.

386
00:24:38,760 --> 00:24:40,320
If you keep refusing,

387
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:44,440
it must be that your injury is feigned.

388
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:49,760
Feigned? What nonsense is that?

389
00:24:52,080 --> 00:24:54,480
Grandmother, you're always
kind and upright,

390
00:24:55,360 --> 00:24:56,400
so of course you don't know
that some people

391
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:58,360
have honeyed words but evil hearts.

392
00:24:58,440 --> 00:24:59,440
They lie all the time,

393
00:25:00,320 --> 00:25:01,760
are cunning by nature,

394
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:04,040
and never change,
however often they're warned.

395
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:07,680
In that case,

396
00:25:09,520 --> 00:25:10,840
thank you, My Lord.

397
00:25:10,920 --> 00:25:12,480
Please send for Physician Zhao.

398
00:25:13,240 --> 00:25:14,080
Yes.

399
00:25:45,600 --> 00:25:46,560
How is it?

400
00:25:47,760 --> 00:25:50,840
This is outrageous.

401
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:53,920
The bone is injured,
yet you act like nothing's wrong.

402
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:55,680
If it isn't set now,

403
00:25:55,760 --> 00:25:58,320
- you'll lose this arm.
- What?

404
00:25:58,960 --> 00:26:00,920
She has a bone injury?

405
00:26:01,440 --> 00:26:04,080
But she seemed fine just now.

406
00:26:04,600 --> 00:26:07,320
How strange. The shoulder is dislocated,

407
00:26:09,120 --> 00:26:12,480
and the elbow and wrist are both sprained.

408
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:16,840
Even a strong man would scream in pain.

409
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:19,840
I know your family are military men,

410
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:23,040
but are you, the new bride,
made of iron too,

411
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:25,640
not saying a word about the pain?

412
00:26:25,720 --> 00:26:27,480
Rao,

413
00:26:27,560 --> 00:26:30,240
this is the pain
of dislocated bones and torn tendons.

414
00:26:30,320 --> 00:26:31,880
Why did you keep quiet?

415
00:26:32,720 --> 00:26:36,760
How can a delicate girl
like you bear this?

416
00:26:37,920 --> 00:26:41,120
I've only been married three days.

417
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:42,840
If I already need the Physician,

418
00:26:43,440 --> 00:26:45,760
and my grandmother and uncle hear of it,

419
00:26:46,280 --> 00:26:48,400
they'll think the Lu family mistreats me.

420
00:26:49,080 --> 00:26:52,200
It would cause bad feelings
between our families for no reason.

421
00:26:53,120 --> 00:26:55,800
And others would gossip.

422
00:26:56,840 --> 00:27:00,400
Grandmother, you're kind
and treat me so well.

423
00:27:00,480 --> 00:27:02,520
You kept His Lordship's waking a secret.

424
00:27:02,600 --> 00:27:04,280
You must have had good reason.

425
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:07,360
I didn't want to make a fuss.

426
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:13,000
I thought I could bear it.
I didn't know the bone was hurt.

427
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:15,680
But don't worry, Grandmother.

428
00:27:16,280 --> 00:27:19,680
I'm young. I can bear a little pain.

429
00:27:24,720 --> 00:27:28,040
VIRTUE IN FRAGRANCE

430
00:27:28,120 --> 00:27:29,880
Are you happy now?

431
00:27:30,560 --> 00:27:34,360
She's your wife,
not your enemy on the battlefield.

432
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:37,200
She's so kind, dutiful and gentle.

433
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:39,560
How could you wrong her?

434
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:42,000
I think your illness
has muddled your mind.

435
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:46,560
Physician Zhao,
my granddaughter-in-law's injury

436
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:48,440
is in your hands.

437
00:27:48,520 --> 00:27:51,760
Don't worry, Old Madam.
For serious injuries,

438
00:27:51,840 --> 00:27:53,160
the bone must be pulled and set first.

439
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,600
It'll hurt. Bear with it.

440
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:58,920
You two, come and hold her down firmly.

441
00:28:01,160 --> 00:28:02,600
Hold her steady.

442
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:06,120
When I pull, she mustn't move at all.

443
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:23,240
It'll be quick. Hold on.

444
00:28:36,320 --> 00:28:38,560
This splinting method
is common in the army.

445
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:40,360
My Lord, you know it too.

446
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:43,680
Soak the cedar bark
in cold water for four hours.

447
00:28:44,280 --> 00:28:46,200
When binding it, leave the joints free.

448
00:28:46,280 --> 00:28:49,600
- Wrist, elbow…
- Wrap them in silk gauze.

449
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:53,600
Please keep an eye on it, My Lord.

450
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:56,240
I will.

451
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,320
See Physician Zhao out.

452
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:32,360
Dowager Lady, the Physician has left.

453
00:29:37,280 --> 00:29:39,400
How did Rao offend you

454
00:29:39,920 --> 00:29:43,520
that you suspect her at every turn,
shut her out, and bully her?

455
00:29:44,120 --> 00:29:46,760
She's a noble young lady
in the prime of youth

456
00:29:46,840 --> 00:29:49,480
who willingly married in
to ward off your illness.

457
00:29:49,560 --> 00:29:52,080
And you treat her so cruelly?

458
00:29:52,880 --> 00:29:54,880
Aren't you afraid
of being struck by lightning?

459
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:58,640
Grandmother,
marrying to ward off illness is nonsense.

460
00:29:58,720 --> 00:29:59,720
- I…
- Well, well.

461
00:30:00,320 --> 00:30:03,000
Now you can breathe and talk,

462
00:30:03,520 --> 00:30:04,600
and all you do is run your mouth
accusing people.

463
00:30:05,520 --> 00:30:08,000
You're so tough and great.

464
00:30:08,080 --> 00:30:10,440
When you lay in bed like the living dead,
have you forgotten all that?

465
00:30:11,360 --> 00:30:15,440
Back then I prayed
to the deities every day.

466
00:30:15,520 --> 00:30:17,920
Wei Rao is the lucky star
I threw away my pride

467
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:20,520
and principles to win over.

468
00:30:20,600 --> 00:30:24,080
You may not believe it, but I do.
Everyone believes it.

469
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:26,360
If you treat Rao even a little badly,

470
00:30:26,440 --> 00:30:29,760
you're heartless and ungrateful,

471
00:30:29,840 --> 00:30:32,080
worse than a dog or pig.

472
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:34,080
Heaven will punish you.

473
00:30:34,600 --> 00:30:38,080
Once Heaven turns against you
and takes your fortune and your life,

474
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:41,280
it will break my heart.

475
00:30:44,520 --> 00:30:45,480
Grandmother.

476
00:30:46,520 --> 00:30:48,680
- I have my reasons.
- I won't listen.

477
00:30:49,280 --> 00:30:50,120
Go back

478
00:30:51,080 --> 00:30:51,960
and apologize to Rao.

479
00:30:52,800 --> 00:30:55,760
Otherwise,
don't ever call me Grandmother again.

480
00:31:12,360 --> 00:31:13,400
I'll be gentler.

481
00:31:29,080 --> 00:31:30,040
Does it hurt?

482
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:46,000
His Lordship is here.

483
00:32:03,320 --> 00:32:05,120
My Lord, what are your orders?

484
00:32:06,120 --> 00:32:07,200
All of you, leave.

485
00:32:28,560 --> 00:32:30,200
If you want to send me away,

486
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:32,840
wait until my injury heals.

487
00:32:33,600 --> 00:32:37,080
If I leave injured, it may harm your name.

488
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:41,280
And Grandmother would never allow it.

489
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:07,800
I wronged you today. Forgive me.

490
00:33:13,600 --> 00:33:15,040
Thank you for saving Che.

491
00:33:23,120 --> 00:33:25,600
You refuse to be my husband

492
00:33:26,120 --> 00:33:27,160
only because back then

493
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:30,480
I made a terrible mistake out of jealousy.

494
00:33:31,520 --> 00:33:34,600
Your disgust for me is understandable.

495
00:33:35,520 --> 00:33:37,200
A forced match is never sweet.

496
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:39,760
I don't want to force you either.

497
00:33:40,800 --> 00:33:42,880
But our marriage
was granted by the Empress Dowager.

498
00:33:43,600 --> 00:33:45,360
To divorce after only three days,

499
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:48,800
first, would disrespect
the Imperial Family

500
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:50,600
and offend the nobles.

501
00:33:51,200 --> 00:33:55,360
Second, it would invite gossip
and hurt both families' good names.

502
00:33:56,120 --> 00:33:59,440
People who don't know
would say I lack virtue

503
00:33:59,520 --> 00:34:00,800
and was thrown out by your family.

504
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:03,400
How could Wei's daughters
marry after that?

505
00:34:04,320 --> 00:34:05,520
Third…

506
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:11,159
Third,

507
00:34:12,480 --> 00:34:14,120
everyone hopes we'll be

508
00:34:15,800 --> 00:34:17,120
a happy couple.

509
00:34:18,120 --> 00:34:20,280
Going against the elders' wishes

510
00:34:21,320 --> 00:34:22,520
also goes against filial duty.

511
00:34:33,320 --> 00:34:34,639
I can't be your husband.

512
00:34:40,920 --> 00:34:44,320
Then please bear with it
for a while, My Lord.

513
00:34:44,840 --> 00:34:47,320
When the time is right,
we'll talk about divorce by agreement.

514
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:49,120
How long?

515
00:34:49,199 --> 00:34:50,480
- Three years.
- One year.

516
00:34:53,880 --> 00:34:54,719
Alright.

517
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,040
One year it is.

518
00:34:57,920 --> 00:34:59,120
But in front of others,

519
00:35:00,080 --> 00:35:01,440
please

520
00:35:02,760 --> 00:35:04,240
let me keep my dignity.

521
00:35:04,760 --> 00:35:06,040
Don't be rude like today.

522
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:14,160
We'll be husband and wife in name only.

523
00:35:14,760 --> 00:35:17,600
A loving couple in public,
separate rooms in private.

524
00:35:17,680 --> 00:35:20,840
No beating servants,
no killing the innocent.

525
00:35:20,920 --> 00:35:22,280
Do your duty as the principal wife.

526
00:35:23,600 --> 00:35:26,640
In front of others,
I'll give you all due honor and respect.

527
00:35:26,720 --> 00:35:29,760
After one year,
we'll divorce by mutual agreement

528
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:31,480
and go our separate ways.

529
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:34,200
Whoever we marry,
we'll have nothing to do with each other.

530
00:35:37,240 --> 00:35:40,120
Let's clap hands on it, My Lord.

531
00:35:40,720 --> 00:35:43,840
- If one day…
- If anyone breaks this oath,

532
00:35:44,600 --> 00:35:46,120
they'll be struck by lightning,
burned by fire,

533
00:35:46,640 --> 00:35:48,240
and cut by swords.

534
00:36:15,040 --> 00:36:16,560
Change the cedar bark every three days.

535
00:36:17,240 --> 00:36:18,080
Get some rest.

536
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:43,920
My Lady,

537
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:47,040
why be so hard on yourself?

538
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:49,480
How could you do that to yourself?

539
00:36:59,040 --> 00:37:00,160
My Lady, you…

540
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:04,800
When I had nowhere to turn,

541
00:37:06,480 --> 00:37:08,280
letting me save that child

542
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:13,520
was Heaven giving me a chance.

543
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:17,400
Compared to the chopping block,

544
00:37:18,280 --> 00:37:19,520
what's this bit of pain?

545
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:22,800
I want to live.

546
00:37:25,600 --> 00:37:28,320
Even if I have to struggle along in shame,

547
00:37:32,080 --> 00:37:33,800
I just want to live.

548
00:37:38,080 --> 00:37:39,960
I made a medicinal pillow
for His Lordship.

549
00:37:40,920 --> 00:37:41,880
Take it to him for me.

550
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:52,920
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

551
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:55,040
My Lord,
Madam sent you a medicinal pillow.

552
00:37:55,120 --> 00:37:56,280
I've put it on for you.

553
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:59,200
Where's today's court gazette?
Why hasn't it come yet?

554
00:38:00,120 --> 00:38:02,840
Governess Miao kept
all the court gazettes I brought.

555
00:38:03,480 --> 00:38:04,320
Forget the gazettes.

556
00:38:05,240 --> 00:38:07,480
The Dowager Lady won't even
let General Qi in.

557
00:38:08,200 --> 00:38:11,040
You forced yourself out of bed yesterday,
and your wound opened up.

558
00:38:11,120 --> 00:38:12,640
If you keep neglecting your health,

559
00:38:13,240 --> 00:38:14,840
Governess Miao will tell the Dowager Lady

560
00:38:14,920 --> 00:38:17,480
and have all of us dragged out
for forty strokes.

561
00:38:17,560 --> 00:38:20,280
Please take pity on us and just rest.

562
00:38:22,040 --> 00:38:23,160
Go.

563
00:38:23,680 --> 00:38:24,840
- Time to eat.
- Well…

564
00:38:38,480 --> 00:38:40,160
Who said you could eat here?

565
00:38:41,440 --> 00:38:43,240
You're resting in the Study,

566
00:38:44,000 --> 00:38:45,480
and as your wife,

567
00:38:46,040 --> 00:38:47,480
I should be here to serve you.

568
00:38:47,560 --> 00:38:50,160
Otherwise, if the elders ask,

569
00:38:50,680 --> 00:38:52,400
what would I tell them?

570
00:38:54,840 --> 00:38:56,080
Oh, Wei Rao.

571
00:38:56,720 --> 00:38:58,840
You've only got one working arm,

572
00:39:01,200 --> 00:39:02,440
and you're still scheming.

573
00:39:03,560 --> 00:39:05,600
What did you call me, My Lord?

574
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:13,120
You got hurt saving Che.
Who would dare blame you?

575
00:39:15,640 --> 00:39:17,920
You're overthinking it,

576
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:21,240
Rao.

577
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:26,400
You're so considerate, My Lord.

578
00:39:26,480 --> 00:39:28,440
How could I slack off?

579
00:39:29,760 --> 00:39:32,080
Eating with you is a small gesture.

580
00:39:32,800 --> 00:39:34,240
It shows we're a loving couple

581
00:39:35,120 --> 00:39:36,920
so the elders won't worry.

582
00:39:58,680 --> 00:40:00,200
Look at your face.

583
00:40:00,280 --> 00:40:03,200
Anyone would think I'd poisoned your bowl.

584
00:40:05,920 --> 00:40:07,280
Forgive my rudeness.

585
00:40:16,040 --> 00:40:18,680
I have no appetite while sick. I'm done.

586
00:40:20,200 --> 00:40:21,160
Don't trouble yourself, Rao.

587
00:40:22,120 --> 00:40:23,400
Go and heal first,

588
00:40:25,040 --> 00:40:26,200
then come look after me.

589
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:30,600
Thank you for your care. I'm so grateful.

590
00:40:52,960 --> 00:40:54,120
What's wrong, Madam?

591
00:40:54,840 --> 00:40:57,360
Nothing.
Maybe I didn't sleep well last night.

592
00:40:57,960 --> 00:40:59,120
YINYU,
MAID OF THE DUKE OF YING'S RESIDENCE

593
00:40:59,200 --> 00:41:00,920
Why isn't Bitao here this morning?

594
00:41:02,560 --> 00:41:04,160
And where are Gejin and Chilan?

595
00:41:04,680 --> 00:41:08,080
Madam, Bitao, Gejin, and Chilan

596
00:41:08,160 --> 00:41:09,280
were all called away by Governess Wu.

597
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:15,000
You told her about the dowry inventory
and shamed me in front of everyone.

598
00:41:15,080 --> 00:41:17,800
- That's for your loose tongues!
- I really didn't tell her.

599
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:21,200
What do I know about gold or jade?
Please spare me, Governess.

600
00:41:21,280 --> 00:41:23,080
That's still you gossiping!

601
00:41:23,160 --> 00:41:26,000
Don't hit them.
I'm the one in charge of the room.

602
00:41:26,080 --> 00:41:28,240
When Her Ladyship asked,
we just answered her.

603
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:30,000
We didn't mean to cross you, Governess.

604
00:41:31,480 --> 00:41:34,120
Governess, stop.
If Her Ladyship finds out, it'll be bad.

605
00:41:34,200 --> 00:41:35,840
I've served the Madam for decades

606
00:41:36,440 --> 00:41:38,360
and trained countless maids.

607
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:40,920
Even the masters show me some respect.

608
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:43,160
How dare you talk back!

609
00:41:43,240 --> 00:41:45,760
- Talk back, will you?
- I'll beat you to death!

610
00:41:45,840 --> 00:41:47,640
What are you doing?
If I can't beat you to death…

611
00:41:50,520 --> 00:41:51,360
My Lady, you're here.

612
00:41:52,320 --> 00:41:53,240
You don't know.

613
00:41:54,000 --> 00:41:56,120
All the valuable dowry items
and the dowry inventory

614
00:41:56,200 --> 00:41:58,720
were supposed to be checked by them
and put into storage.

615
00:41:58,800 --> 00:42:01,440
But they were all lazy and careless.

616
00:42:01,520 --> 00:42:03,920
They packed away
the embroidered goods and jewelry

617
00:42:04,000 --> 00:42:04,840
meant as greeting gifts too.

618
00:42:06,040 --> 00:42:08,920
I'm old, and my memory is poor.

619
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:10,440
They didn't remind me,

620
00:42:11,040 --> 00:42:13,560
so you went to
all that trouble for nothing.

621
00:42:13,640 --> 00:42:15,400
You nearly lost face before the Lu family.

622
00:42:15,480 --> 00:42:17,960
- They must be punished.
- How dare you!

623
00:42:19,200 --> 00:42:20,160
Did you ask me?

624
00:42:20,760 --> 00:42:22,080
This is the Duke's Residence.

625
00:42:22,600 --> 00:42:24,320
Beating their faces black and blue

626
00:42:24,400 --> 00:42:25,960
only makes people think
we have no manners.

627
00:42:27,000 --> 00:42:28,400
Bitao, go put some medicine on.

628
00:42:34,560 --> 00:42:37,840
As you say, My Lady.
When have I ever disobeyed?

629
00:42:37,920 --> 00:42:40,400
Fine, I won't punish them.

630
00:42:40,920 --> 00:42:43,760
But since you married into
the Duke's Residence,

631
00:42:44,400 --> 00:42:46,200
His Lordship's illness

632
00:42:46,280 --> 00:42:48,000
made you miss the return
to the bride's family on the third day.

633
00:42:48,800 --> 00:42:50,600
The Wei masters worry day and night,

634
00:42:51,200 --> 00:42:53,280
hoping you'll visit home soon.

635
00:42:56,960 --> 00:42:59,800
His Lordship is ill, and so am I.

636
00:43:00,400 --> 00:43:01,840
If I go back now,

637
00:43:01,920 --> 00:43:04,360
should the Wei elders
see His Lordship sick,

638
00:43:04,440 --> 00:43:06,440
or me with a broken bone
who can't even hold chopsticks?

639
00:43:13,840 --> 00:43:15,400
The Wei Residence is so strange.

640
00:43:15,480 --> 00:43:17,120
They beat maids harder than thieves.

641
00:43:20,240 --> 00:43:22,160
A bunch of thieving maids.

642
00:43:22,240 --> 00:43:24,440
Shameless wretches.

643
00:43:24,520 --> 00:43:26,560
Think you're the masters now?

644
00:43:27,840 --> 00:43:31,760
Once we're back at the Wei Residence,
you'll get what's coming.

645
00:43:37,200 --> 00:43:40,600
- Cui, is the lotus seed soup ready?
- Almost.

646
00:43:41,560 --> 00:43:44,920
Governess Wu said she lost a ring
in the garden and sent me to find it.

647
00:43:45,000 --> 00:43:46,920
She's minding the fire for me.

648
00:43:47,680 --> 00:43:49,120
Alright, go.

649
00:44:10,320 --> 00:44:12,360
Meddling poor wench.

650
00:44:12,440 --> 00:44:13,880
What a lowlife.

651
00:44:15,320 --> 00:44:17,200
You only deserve my spit.

652
00:44:29,400 --> 00:44:32,400
Eat it. Eat it.

653
00:44:55,640 --> 00:44:58,480
I'm just a stupid fool.

654
00:44:58,560 --> 00:45:00,040
Getting angry with me

655
00:45:00,640 --> 00:45:04,240
is no different from getting angry
with an animal.

656
00:45:05,160 --> 00:45:08,160
I apologize to you again.

657
00:45:09,560 --> 00:45:11,880
Of all the people from the Wei Residence,

658
00:45:12,480 --> 00:45:14,840
only you and Bitao know who I really am.

659
00:45:15,880 --> 00:45:17,560
I don't blame you for your rudeness,

660
00:45:18,160 --> 00:45:20,280
but we're both in the Lu family now.

661
00:45:21,000 --> 00:45:22,480
We should stick together.

662
00:45:23,640 --> 00:45:25,040
If you keep making trouble

663
00:45:25,920 --> 00:45:27,680
and the boat sinks,

664
00:45:27,760 --> 00:45:29,040
we'll be charged
with deceiving the Emperor.

665
00:45:29,760 --> 00:45:31,120
Who would gain from that?

666
00:45:31,720 --> 00:45:35,080
Yes. You're generous
and forgiving, My Lady.

667
00:45:35,160 --> 00:45:37,040
I'll change completely.

668
00:45:43,280 --> 00:45:48,480
The Old Madam of the Duke's Residence
heard you can't eat or sleep well

669
00:45:48,560 --> 00:45:50,480
and sent this specially.

670
00:45:50,560 --> 00:45:52,160
It's made with red dates and lotus seeds.

671
00:45:52,240 --> 00:45:54,200
It's light, tasty and calms the mind.

672
00:45:54,280 --> 00:45:56,640
Why not have some more?

673
00:46:11,760 --> 00:46:14,600
No wonder you've had no appetite
and no strength.

674
00:46:15,280 --> 00:46:16,920
You have a fever.

675
00:46:17,760 --> 00:46:18,640
My head hurts badly too.

676
00:46:20,120 --> 00:46:22,920
Go fetch Governess Miao. Tell her…

677
00:46:23,000 --> 00:46:25,320
My Lady, a sudden high fever is bad.

678
00:46:26,080 --> 00:46:28,880
Could it be a chill stirring up
a hidden illness?

679
00:46:28,960 --> 00:46:30,960
This must be spring fever.

680
00:46:32,040 --> 00:46:35,600
My Lady, the Duke's Residence
cares a lot about custom.

681
00:46:35,680 --> 00:46:38,200
You, as a new bride,
are falling ill right after marrying in.

682
00:46:38,280 --> 00:46:39,960
If you stay here to recover,

683
00:46:40,040 --> 00:46:42,000
you'll bring disaster to the Lu family.

684
00:46:42,760 --> 00:46:46,000
You must go back to your own family
and return once you're well.

685
00:46:48,640 --> 00:46:52,160
My Lady,
drink more of this lotus seed soup.

686
00:46:52,240 --> 00:46:53,080
You'll get better faster.

687
00:47:00,520 --> 00:47:03,840
Don't listen to her, My Lady.
This woman wants to kill you.

688
00:47:06,040 --> 00:47:07,400
Let go!

689
00:47:08,720 --> 00:47:12,480
My Lady, I saw she put something
in the lotus seed soup.

690
00:47:12,560 --> 00:47:14,440
I'm afraid even the bean porridge
you eat every day

691
00:47:14,520 --> 00:47:15,520
has been tampered with.

692
00:47:17,280 --> 00:47:18,920
You heartless little wench.

693
00:47:19,000 --> 00:47:20,400
You're framing me!

694
00:47:20,480 --> 00:47:23,160
No wonder she has been finding fault
with me all day.

695
00:47:23,240 --> 00:47:25,560
So you've been stirring things up.

696
00:47:26,120 --> 00:47:28,480
I'll tear your mouth apart. I…

697
00:47:28,560 --> 00:47:29,960
- Stop.
- I'll beat you to death.

698
00:47:30,040 --> 00:47:34,440
The First Madam sent me here,
and you dare falsely accuse me, huh?

699
00:47:34,520 --> 00:47:36,640
- Open your eyes and see clearly.
- Stop!

700
00:47:37,240 --> 00:47:39,760
Know your place, high or low!

701
00:47:39,840 --> 00:47:41,480
- Bitao.
- Let me tell you,

702
00:47:41,560 --> 00:47:43,880
a bald turtledove
will never be a phoenix. You…

703
00:47:44,400 --> 00:47:46,920
Think about where you come from.

704
00:47:47,520 --> 00:47:50,320
To be the servant of a servant like me,
you're not even worthy!

705
00:47:51,360 --> 00:47:54,400
- You brat. You dare frame me.
- Bitao.

706
00:47:55,160 --> 00:47:57,800
I'll beat you to death. Beat you to death!

707
00:48:05,320 --> 00:48:07,680
My Lady… My Lady.

708
00:48:11,600 --> 00:48:15,320
Very well. You impostor.

709
00:48:15,400 --> 00:48:19,320
You're pushing me too far.
Let's go to His Lordship and settle this.

710
00:48:20,000 --> 00:48:24,000
We'll see if he still wants
a lowborn wife like you.

711
00:48:26,000 --> 00:48:27,560
I'll smash you to death!

712
00:49:03,120 --> 00:49:03,960
She…

713
00:49:06,080 --> 00:49:06,920
She's dead.

714
00:49:11,280 --> 00:49:12,320
Dead?

715
00:49:18,400 --> 00:49:19,600
My Lady…

716
00:49:21,400 --> 00:49:22,440
I…

717
00:49:23,240 --> 00:49:25,000
I killed someone.

718
00:49:36,160 --> 00:49:37,000
Who's there?

719
00:49:50,320 --> 00:49:52,360
<i>I caught her tampering</i>
<i>with the lotus seed soup.</i>

720
00:49:53,360 --> 00:49:55,560
<i>I thought she was just trying</i>
<i>to make you suffer, My Lady.</i>

721
00:49:59,720 --> 00:50:03,600
<i>I wanted her to taste her own medicine</i>
<i>and pay for it.</i>

722
00:50:03,680 --> 00:50:06,520
<i>I never thought she'd…</i>

723
00:50:07,640 --> 00:50:09,640
She wanted me to catch spring fever

724
00:50:10,160 --> 00:50:12,200
so the Lu family would fear it

725
00:50:12,280 --> 00:50:15,000
and send me back to my family,

726
00:50:15,520 --> 00:50:17,320
making it easier for them to act later.

727
00:50:17,920 --> 00:50:18,920
This drug

728
00:50:20,440 --> 00:50:21,960
wasn't just added today.

729
00:50:23,080 --> 00:50:25,400
I must have shamed her in public.

730
00:50:25,480 --> 00:50:26,880
She held a grudge,

731
00:50:27,960 --> 00:50:29,320
so she used too much.

732
00:50:30,320 --> 00:50:32,920
Then I…

733
00:50:33,600 --> 00:50:35,080
She plotted to hurt others

734
00:50:35,640 --> 00:50:36,920
and lost her own life.

735
00:50:37,520 --> 00:50:38,800
It's not your fault.

736
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:43,160
I should thank you for saving my life.

737
00:50:46,520 --> 00:50:49,080
My Lady,
you've only been married a few days,

738
00:50:49,160 --> 00:50:50,640
and your dowry attendant is already dead.

739
00:50:50,720 --> 00:50:54,920
People who don't know the truth
may blame you for her death.

740
00:50:55,000 --> 00:50:56,560
What do we do now?

741
00:51:00,400 --> 00:51:03,400
- My Lady…
- Madam, His Lordship is here.

742
00:53:16,320 --> 00:53:19,000
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
